(1) Dispositions or measures taken or other acts done by or to administrative agencies under the previous Act on Preserving Agricultural Income and the previous Enforcement Regulations on Direct Payment Program for Producers of Agricultural Products as at the time this Act enters into force shall be deemed dispositions or measures taken or acts done by or to administrative agencies under this Act.
(2) The environment-friendly agriculture direct payment program, direct payment program for environment-friendly and safe livestock, and landscape conservation direct payment program implemented under Article 11(2) of the Special Act on the Implementation of the Agreement Establishing the World Trade Organization shall be governed by the relevant provisions of this Act on or after the date this Act enters into force.
